.SH "نام (NAME)"
lr_xml2mail \- Formats a XML report and sends it by email
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.IX Header "SYNOPSIS"
\&\fBlr_xml2mail\fR \fB[\fR\fIoptions\fR\fB]\fR \fIreport.xml\fR \fIrecipieint\fR...
.PP
\&\fBlr_xml2mail\fR \fB\-\-version\fR
.PP
\&\fBlr_xml2mail\fR \fB\-\-help\fR \fB[dlf\-converters|output\-formats|report\-templates]\fR
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.IX Header "OPTIONS"
.IP "\fB\-\-help\fR \fB[\fR\fIsection\fR\fB]\fR" 4
.IX Item "--help [section]"
If no argument is given, prints usage information and exits. Argument
can be one of the following:
.RS 4
.IP dlf\-converters 4
.IX Item "dlf-converters"
Prints the list of available DLF converters and exits.
.IP output\-formats 4
.IX Item "output-formats"
Prints the list of available output formats and exits.
.IP report\-templates 4
.IX Item "report-templates"
Prints the list of available report templates and exits.
.RE
.RS 4
.RE
.IP "\fB\-\-output\-format\fR \fIoutput format\fR" 4
.IX Item "--output-format output format"
Selects the ouput format in which to generate the report.
.IP "\fB\-\-template\fR \fIname\fR" 4
.IX Item "--template name"
Uses the report configuration template named \fIname\fR to merge the
reports. This option is required when using the \fB\-\-merge\fR option to
merge reports.
.IP "\fB\-\-merge\fR \fIreport_file\fR" 4
.IX Item "--merge report_file"
Merge \fIreport_file\fR before formatting the report. This option can be
used multiple times to merge more than two reports.
.IP "\fB\-\-subject\fR \fIsubject\fR" 4
.IX Item "--subject subject"
Sets the subject of the email message. Defaults to \*(AqYour \fIformat\fR report\*(Aq.
.IP "\fB\-\-extra\-file\fR \fIfile\fR" 4
.IX Item "--extra-file file"
An additional text file that will be sent along the report. If the
output format is txt, it will be appended to the report.
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.IX Header "DESCRIPTION"
\&\fBlr_xml2mail\fR formats the XML reports generated by Lire to various
output format and sends it by email to the recipients specified as
remaining arguments.
.PP
The command will make sure the report is MIME encapsulated
properly depending on the output format chosen. For example, a PDF
report will be sent as an attachment and (X)HTML output will appear as
an HTML mail message. The content\-type of the MIME message will also
be set properly.
.PP
From and Reply\-To headers are initialized from the \f(CW\*(C`lr_from\*(C'\fR and
\&\f(CW\*(C`lr_reply_to\*(C'\fR configuration variables.
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.IX Header "SEE ALSO"
\&\fBlr_log2mail\fR\|(1), \fBlr_log2report\fR\|(1), \fBlr_xml2report\fR\|(1), \fBlire\fR\|(1), \fBlire\fR\|(7),
documentation in the Lire User Manual
